  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Sun Yuan Hua is the first of the ten children of human path to enter Heavenly Court’s derivation formation. After a nightmare-like encounter in white fog among a sea of humans with fake smiles, he steps out and finds, in the depth of his mind, the Immortal Gu recipe of shadow puppet Gu. Shadow puppet Gu and musician Gu are both human path Gu worms, and they are Sun Yuan Hua’s and Gu Ting’s vital Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2284
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sun_yuan_hua",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "sys_gu_recipe",
          "gu_musician_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "char_gu_ting",
          "sys_vital_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inside the formation Sun Yuan Hua chases a human figure through white fog until countless people surround him, all smiling in a fake way that looks like a painting drawn using lines. He is engulfed by that sea of humans. When he regains his senses outside the formation, the Immortal Gu recipe of shadow puppet Gu is in his mind.",
        "chapters": [
          2284
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "formation-vision",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable explains that after Sun Yuan Hua entered the formation, his comprehension and understanding of human path resonated with the inheritance of Heavenly Court’s former shadow path Gu Immortal, Immortal Monarch Gu Ying, and thus he obtained the Immortal Gu recipe of shadow puppet Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2284
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "inheritance-resonance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "char_immortal_monarch_gu_ying"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
